/**
 * RIX PANEL — Cloudflare Workers VPN Management Panel
 * Single-file, deploy-ready. Backend + API + VLESS/Trojan + Subs + Admin UI + Public page.
 *
 * Deploy: wrangler + KV binding `KV`. See bottom setup notes (also in chat answer).
 *
 * Cloudflare constraints honored:
 *  - No Node APIs (no fs/net/crypto-module/process/Buffer/child_process)
 *  - Only Web APIs + `cloudflare:sockets` for outbound TCP
 *  - KV (`env.KV`) is the only durable storage; in-memory Map is TEST fallback only
 *
 * Key design:
 *  - KV keys are namespace-based under `rix:` (see KV_KEYS / storage layer comments)
 *  - UUID -> user.id cache with 30s TTL, invalidated on every user mutation
